# AI Configuration Overrides

This file configures AI agent behavior for this project.
Copy to `config.local.md` and customize as needed.

## Personal Knowledge Path

Override the default personal knowledge storage location:

```
personal_knowledge_path: ~/.local/share/zappzarapp/
```

Default: `~/.local/share/zappzarapp/`

The personal layer stores private notes (LEARNINGS.md, etc.)
that are not shared with the team. Tasks are managed via `/tasks --private`.
